     "notes": "Od (Optimal Dehumidification) may over-cool the space by 2 deg F to hit the humidity target; available when AC1/AC2/HP1/HP2. Oc (Optimal Comfort) only dehumidifies on a call for cool and requires indoor equipment GA1/EL1/Fan with outdoor AC1/AC2/HP1/HP2."
