  "stages": "1 heat + 1 cool. Configurable as Single Stage 1 (SS1) or Heat Pump 1 (HP1, single stage compressor heat pump with aux/emergency heat). Applications: gas, oil, electric, heat only, cool only or heat/cool, 2- or 3-wire hydronic zone (hot water or steam), 24 v...",
  "sort": 20,
