   "No C-wire installs use the included LUX Power Bridge, wired at the FURNACE control board (not at the thermostat): old Y/W/R/G wires land on Power Bridge terminals 1/2/3/4 respectively, and new labeled Power Bridge wires go back onto the furnace board in their place.",
