   "factoryReset": "HARDWARE RESET (HW RST button): re-reads settings, cycles relays, does NOT erase programs. SOFTWARE RESET: with Keypad Lockout OFF and System Mode in OFF, hold UP+DOWN+NEXT together 5+ seconds - erases ALL heat/cool programs and returns all settings to factory defaults; clock must be reset after."
