   "24 VAC systems only - millivolt or high-voltage systems are not compatible.",
   "Compatible thermostats: Nest Thermostat (2020+), Nest Thermostat E, Nest Learning Thermostat 3rd gen, and Nest Learning Thermostat 4th gen (per the current Nest Power Connector support page); 1st/2nd gen need professional consultation per that same page.",
   "Four documented wiring scenarios in the install guide: (A) cooling and heating system - wire to Y; (B) heating-only system; (C) cooling-only system; (D) no C-terminal on the equipment - professional installation recommended.",
   "The HVAC equipment cover MUST be closed before power is restored - many systems have a safety switch that prevents operation with the cover open; this is also the fix for an N260 help code seen while installing the Power Connector.",
   "Use the included wire connectors: lift the lever to 90 degrees, insert the wire, snap the lever down, then tug gently to confirm it's secure.",
   "Nest Thermostat (current models) needs a software update (v1.1+) before installing the Power Connector, checked via Settings > Version > Update on the thermostat; 3rd gen Learning Thermostat and Nest Thermostat E need no update.",
