   "Connect 1, 2, R, C from the CTK04/CTK03 to 1, 2, R, C at the Indoor Board; connect only wires 1 and 2 from the Indoor Board to 1 and 2 at the Outdoor Board. Do NOT connect R and C between the Indoor Board and the Outdoor Board.",
   "CTK03/CTK04 support RedLINK wireless accessories: Internet Gateway (adds Wi-Fi/app access to any wireless-enabled thermostat), Wireless Indoor Sensor (change sensing location or average temperature across rooms), Wireless Outdoor Sensor (outdoor temp/humidity display), Wireless Humidity Control adapter (control a TrueSTEAM humidifier without new wiring), and a Portable Comfort Control handheld sensor/remote.",
