   "installerTest": "Menu > Settings > Advanced Settings > View Support Service Control Center > Tests > Automated Test (unattended full suite, saves an installation/performance report accessible on LennoxPros) or Manual Test (technician selects/deselects individual tests).",
   "factoryReset": "Not independently documented for the S40 in the sources reviewed. The architecturally identical S30 uses Menu > Settings > Advanced Settings > View Support/Dealer Service Control Center > Utilities > Factory Reset Thermostat (separate option from Factory Reset smart hub) - likely the same path on S40 given identical menu wording elsewhere, but not confirmed against an S40-specific source."
