  "power": {
   "cWire": "required",
   "batteries": "",
   "notes": "The control is powered from the ABCD bus: C = 24VAC common, D = 24VAC hot, supplied by the indoor unit. There is no separate R/C thermostat hookup and no battery backup. Some outdoor units (typically multi-compressor-stage units) provide their own low-voltage power and do not need the C and D connections at the outdoor end - see that outdoor unit's instructions. Source: SYSTXCCITC-12SI sec 4.4."
  },
