   "notes": "24VAC only. Requires Rh and/or Rc plus C to operate - it will not run without both connections. Rh and Rc are tied by a PCB breakout jumper from the factory. Two-transformer job: land both commons on C, indoor R on Rh, outdoor R on Rc, then BREAK the board jumper. If a 2-transformer job later becomes single-transformer, the installer must add a field jumper between Rc and Rh. W is powered from Rh, G is powered from Rc. Source: TP-PACA-02SI Installation Considerations / Power."
