   "FV / FK fan coils: remove the J1 jumper on the fan coil board to enable the dehumidify (DH) input.",
   "Two-stage air conditioners: remove the J2 jumper for heat staging per Fig. 23.",
   "Do NOT hang the Display Module from the ECM screw terminals.",
   "Do not mount the Equipment Control Module on ductwork or below other controls / equipment."
