  "stages": "Configurable for typical fan coil, FK/FV series fan coil, fan coil, 1-stage furnace, 2-stage furnace, variable-speed 2-stage non-condensing furnace, and variable-speed 2-stage condensing furnace with DE connection; each paired with single-speed AC, two-spee...",
  "sort": 30,
